odeVoice"},{"text":" parameter.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"fn"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The value continuation is resumed with.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The body of the closure executes synchronously on the calling task, and once it returns","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the calling task is suspended. It is possible to immediately resume the task, or escape the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"continuation in order to complete it afterwards, which will then resume the suspended task.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resume(throwing:)"},{"text":" is called on the continuation, this function throws that error.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You must invoke the continuation’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resume"},{"text":" method exactly once.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Missing to invoke it (eventually) will cause the calling task to remain suspended","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"indefinitely which will result in the task “hanging” as well as being leaked with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no possibility to destroy it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike the “checked” continuation variant, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnsafeContinuation"},{"text":" does not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"detect or diagnose any kind of misuse, so you need to be extra careful to avoid","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"calling ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resume"},{"tex